<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="EST" style="id">Esther</book>
  <para style="h">Esther</para>
  <para style="toc1">Esther</para>
  <para style="toc2">Esther</para>
  <para style="mt">Esther</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Persia ngam khuapi Susa khua kumpi tokhum tung panin Xerxes kumpipa in India pan Ethiopia dong ngamke 127 uk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kumpi a sep a kum thum kumin a uliante theampo le zum ukte atu in anneakpoai khat vawt hi. Tualai ah, Persia le Media ngalkaphonpite, ngamuk mangte le kumpi uliante om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kumpipa in a ngam haunate le kumpi zum ii vaang neina, nasiatna taw a thupiziate tha luk sung bup lak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua zawkciang kumpipa in Susa khuapi sungah a om pasal theampo a hau, a zawng a kibangin anneakpoai khat vawtsak hi. Tua poai nipi khat sung bup kumpi inn huante sungah kivawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua mun a suumsung sia patpuankhai vancii le a kaangte taw kizeam a, tua puankhakte a ci pha puanneal sandup khaute taw marble suangkaang khuamte tungah ngunnkualte taw kikhii hi. Tua suumsung teng marble suang a kaang, a san, a tee keptang le vancii meal suangmanpha bangte kipha in, a tungah khamh le ngunn taw a kivawt tokhumte kikoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sapittui te khat le khat a kibang ngawl khamh hai taw kihawm vazia a, kumpipa in a kumpi sapittui te ciil vawt ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sapittui neak tu za ciangtan om ngawl a; a kuama po in a du za a neak natu in kumpipa in kumpi inn sung naseamte thupia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua poai hun sungin Vashti kumpinu in kumpi inn sungah numeite atu in anneakpoai khat vawtsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A poaikhaam ni sali ni in kumpipa sapittui ne in nuamsa ahikom ama aituam naseam, numei uk cilnge sa pasal sali Mehuman, Biztha, Harbona, Bigtha, Abagtha, Zethar le Carkas te sam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kumpipa in amate tungah Vashti kumpinu a kumpilukhu khu in ama kungah a paipui natu in thupia hi. Kumpinu sia numei mealpha khat hi a, kumpipa in uliante le a leangnate theampo tungah kumpinu mealhoina lak nuam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahizong a naseamte in kumpipa thupiakna Vashti kumpinu tungah a son uh ciang kumpinu in nialin pai nuam ngawl hi. Tua hu in kumpipa thinso hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tu in upadi zui natu ngeina huvau thudokna a pian ciang, ama in a pil a thiamte ngaisutna a dok tu sia kumpi ngeina ahikom ama in bang vawt tu ci a he, ngaisutna a piate sam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama ii ngaisutna a dok tawntung belte sia Carshena, Shethar, Admatha, Tarshish, Meres, Marsena le Memucan — Persia le Media ngam ulian salite hi a, kumpi ngam sungah zum lianbelte uk uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama in hi uliante tungah, “Keima Xerxes kumpipa in ka naseamte sawlin Vashti kumpinu ka samsak a, ahizong ama in ka thu hong nial hi! Ama tungah ih vawt tu sia upadi in bang ci ziam,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Memucan in kumpipa le a uliante tungah: “Vashti kumpinu in kumpipa bek hi ngawlin, a uliante — a tatakin ci leang kumpi uk sungah a om pasal theampo hong zawngsak hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kumpinu ngamtatna a zaak pawpo ciang, kumpi uk sungah a om numei theampo in amate ii pasal tek nomu paih tu hi. Amate in, ‘Xerxes kumpipa in Vashti kumpinu sia ama kungah a pai natu thupia napi a thu nial hi,’ ci tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Persia le Media ngamsung uliante ii zite in kumpinu ngamtatna teng a zaak po ciang nitum ma in tua thu a pasalte tungah son tu uh hi. Mun theampo ah zite in a pasalte zakta nawn ngawl tu a, a pasalte sia a zite tungah thin uuk tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kumpipa na lung a kim le, Vashti sia kumpipa mai ah a kilak kik ngei nawn ngawl natu in kumpi thu thansakna khat vawt in. Tuasia a kilaih kik thei nawn ngawl tu in Persia le Media te upadi sungah a ki at natu thupia in. Tua zawkciang ama kumpinu dinmun ah numei phazaw khat koi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na thu thansakna sia a lian mama hi kumpi ukna ngam theampo ah a kiheak ciang numei theampo in amate ii pasalte hau kale zawng kale pha takin zatak vawt tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kumpipa le a uliante in hi ngaisutna pha sa a, Memucan ii ngaisutna a piak bangin kumpipa ngamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Zi neisa pasal theampo sia amate ii bangkua tek ii topa hi tu a, a thuneibel hi tu hi ci in, ama in tua kumpi ukna ngam sim ah a kampau tek le a lai tek taw thu zaaksakna khat puak hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua nungciang kumpipa ii thin uukna a thai zawkciang ngawngawnin ama in Vashti ngamtatna le a tungah a thu thansakna sia ngaisun top hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ahiciang kumpipa kung a om a thudok pawlkhatte in, “Banghangin ngaknu thiangtho mealpha pawlkhat zongsak ngawl ni ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na ukna ngamke theampo ah ngaknu mealpha teng hi lai Susa khuapi sung numeite teenna munah hong puak tu in uliante panmun pia thei ni hi. Na numeite a uk cilnge sa Hegai ii kep tu in koi in a, amate tualai ah a mealphat natu in kipuuasak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuasia ciang pha na sakbel numei sia la in a, Vashti taangin kumpinu suaksak in” ci in ngaisutna pia uh hi. Kumpipa in hi ngaisutna sia phasa in zui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualai Susa khuapi ah Jew te Jair tapa Mordecai kici khat teang hi; ama sia Benjamin minam hi a, Kish le Shimei ii suan khat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Babylon kumpipa Nebuchadnezzar in Judah kumpipa Jehoiachin le a ngalmat honkhat Jerusalem pan saltaang tu in a paipui lai in Mordecai kihel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in suapuiseal khat nei in, Hebrew min, Hadassah kici Esther hi a; tua nu a mealpha in a khanhoi hi. A nute a pate a thi ciang Esther sia Mordecai in la a, ama tanu tatak bangin khoi in khangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kumpipa in tua thu thansakna thak a suasak ciang Susa ah ngaknu tam mama hong kipaipui a, Esther kihel hi. Ama zongh numeite teenna a uk Hegai khutnuai kumpi inn sungah kikoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hegai in Esther diksa in maipha pia hi. Ama in Esther mealphat natu in kin vawt a, kimetsak in, an tuam taw vaak hi. Ama in tua nu numeite teenna munah omna phabel pia a, kumpi inn pan a kitealtuam numei salite in khoisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tu in Mordecai ii ngaisutna a piak bangin Esther in Jew te a hina thu iimcip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ni simin Mordecai in Esther bang bang in om a, bang suak lai tu ci in a heak natu in numeite teenna leitual mai ah kilee nithi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Numeite mealphat natu a kipua hun kum khat sung hi a — myrrh sathau namtui taw tha luk sung le balsam sathau taw tha luk sung kimet hi. Tua zawkciang numeite khat zawkciang khat kumpi Xerxes kungah kipaipui tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Numeite teenna pan kumpi inn sungah ama a pai ciang puan a silh nop po silh thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualai ah ama nitak sang in pai a, a zingsang ciang numeite teenna mundang ah kipaipui kikin kumpipa zinote a uk cil kingetpa Shaashgaz tungah ki aap tu hi. Kumpipa in diksa a, a min taw a sam kik buanale ama sia kumpipa kung pai kik ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kumpipa kungah Esther a pai tu hun hong theng hi. Esther sia Abihail ii tanu hi a, a tanu tu in a la Mordecai ii suapui sealh hi; Esther sia a mu pawpo in hoisa hi. Ama pai hun a thet ciang numeite teenna a uk, cil kingetpa Hegai ii a sawl bang linlian in puansilh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuabangin Xerxes ii kumpi a sep a kum sali kum, a tha sawmna, Tebeth tha in Esther sia kumpi inn sung Kumpi Xerxes kungah kipaipui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kumpipa in ngaknu dangte sangin ama hoi sa zaw a, a dangte sangin maipha pia zaw in, it zaw hi. Ama in a lu tungah kumpilukhu khusak a, Vashti dinmun ah kumpinu suaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua zawkciang kumpipa in Esther patoaina in anneakpoai lian khat vawt a, a uliante le zum nasep uk theampo sam siat hi. Ama in kumpi ukna ngamsung bup zum kha ni khat tu in thangsak a, kumpipa taw a kiphu, a kilawm letsongte hawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua hun sungin kumpipa in Mordecai sia nasep uk dinmun khat pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Esther in ahile Jew te a hina kihesak ngawl lai hi. Mordecai in kuama tung a son ngawl natu sawl a, a no lai a thu a nit bangma in hi thu huvau zong ah a thu ni hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mordecai in kumpi inn ah zum na a sep hun sungin, kumpipa inndoi sung tumna a cing numei uk cil kinget niite ahi, Bigthana le Teresh in Xerxes kumpipa ngalvawtin, thalup sawm ku uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mordecai in tua thu a heak ciang Esther kumpinu tungah son a, Mordecai ii a heak thute ama in kumpipa tungah son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hi thute a kat ciang thumaan a hina mu ahikom tuate ngeal sia ngui ki awklumsak hi. Hi thu teng theampo kumpi ukna ngamsung zum thu tepteena te sungah a kikhum natu in kumpipa in thupia hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tawmvei zawkciang Xerxes kumpipa in Haman a kici khat sia vuanzi lianbel in a za khanto hi. Haman sia Agag suan Hammedatha tapa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zatakna piakna in Haman mai ah khupdin in a kun natu Kumpipa in a khutnuai ulian theampo tungah thupia hi. A dang teng in tuabangin zatakna pia napi Mordecai in nial hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kumpi ulian dangte in kumpipa thupiakna sia banghangin zui nuam ngawl ni ziam, ci in dongh uh hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />amate in ni khat zawk ni khat a zui natu sawsawl napi Mordecai in thudon nuam tuan ngawl hi. Ama in, “Keima in Jew mi hi a, Haman mai ah ka kun thei buatu hi,” ci in thiang son hi. Tua ahiciang amate in Mordecai ii ngamtatna a thuak zo ka tawm ci in ngaisun kawm ma in Haman tungah hi thu son uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mordecai ii khupdin in a kun ngawlna thu Haman in a heak ciang a thinso hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />tuaciang, Mordecai sia Jew mi a hina thu ama in a heak ciang Mordecai khat bek daan piak ngawl tu in, khensat hi. Ama in Persia kumpi ukna ngam bup ah a teang Jew mi theampo mot siat tu in ngeal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Xerxes kumpipa ii kumpi a sep a kum sawm le kum nii kum, tha masa, Nisan tha in, a sawmna bang a vawt natu in bang ni bang tha phabel ziam he nuam ahikom (“purim” a kici) lai mee vawt tu in Haman in thupia hi. Adar tha, tha sawm le tha niina, ni sawm le ni thum ni in vawt tu khensat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ahiciang Haman in kumpipa tungah, “Na kumpi ukna ngamsung theampo ah a kithethaang le ngamke theampo ah a kimu minam khat om hi. Amate ii zui a ngeinate sia midangte a taw kibang ngawl hi. Tua banah na kumpi ukna ngamsung upadi te zui nuam ngawl ahikom tuate na koithong tu sia nang atu in pha ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kumpipa awng, na lung a kim le, amate a kithalup natu in thutan in. Tuabangin thu na tan le kumpi ukna ngam vaihawmna sungah zak tu in kumpi sum le vanh manpha sungah keima ngunntang kilogramme 340,000 vaal kong piak tu in kong kamciam hi,” ci in son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kumpipa in tua thuthansakna sia zum thu a sua thei natu laitupna in a kizangh a khutzungbu suut a, Jew mite ngal Agag suan Hammedatha tapa Haman tungah pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kumpipa in ama tungah, “Tua mite le a dangkate nangma aa hi; na uk bang po vawt in,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ahiciang tha masabel ni sawm le ni thum ni in, Haman in kumpipa ii thuzeakte sam a, kumpi ukna sungah a om kampau nam theampo le amate ii zak lai taw pheen in at tu in thuthansakna khat sonin atsak hi. Tua lai sia ngamukte, ngamukmangte le uliante theampo tungah puak tu ahi hi. Tua lai sia Xerxes kumpipa min taw a kisuaksak hi a, a khutzungbu kituum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Laitaite in hi thuthansakna sia kumpi ukna ngamsung a om ngamke theampo ah puak uh hi. Tuasia sungah Adar tha, ni sawm le ni thum ni, ni khat sungin Jew te theampo — a moi le a haam, numeite le patangte — a kimot natu thupiakna teng om hi. Amate kihesuak ngawlin kithat tu a, a neisa teng kilaaksak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ni hong thet ciang a kuama po a kingin thei natu in tua thuthansakna teng ngamke theampo ah ngammite heak tu in kizasak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kumpipa ii thupiakna taw Susa khuapi ah tua thutanna a heak kim natu in kizasak a, laitaite in tua thuthak sia ngamkete ah puak uh hi. Susa khuapi sungah a buaisak laitakin kumpipa le Haman tokhawm in zu ne uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mordecai in hi thu vawtna teng a heak ciang a thinna sa in a puan balkeak hi. Tua zawkciang khau-ip puan silhin a lu tungah vut poai a, nasia tak kapin tau in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />khuapi kaantan a, kumpi inn kongbiang a thet dong pai hi. A sungah ama tum ngawl hi, banghang ziam cile khau-ip puan silhte a sungah kuama kitumsak ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kumpipa thuthansakna a kiheaksakna ngamke theampo ah Jew te nasia tak khuangai in om hi. Amate an tang a, kapin tau in, a tamzaw khau-ip puan silhin vut sungah lum uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Esther naseam numeite le numei uk cil kingette in Mordecai ngamtatna teng ama tungah a son uh ciang nasia takin Esther thinngim hi. Esther in Mordecai sia khau-ip puan a silh taangin a silh tu puan pawlkhat piasak ahihang ama in saang nuam ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Esther in kumpipa ii ama naseam tu a koi numei uk cil kingetpa Hathach samin, Mordecai kungah paisak a, thupiang teng a pian theina thu kan in sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hathach sia Mordecai omna ahi kumpi inn tumna khuapi leitual ah pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mordecai in thupiang theampo son siat a, Jew te theampo a kimon le, kumpi sum le vanh manpha tungah dangka a piak tu za Haman in kamciam a piakna dongin son siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jew te a suksiat natu thu Susa khuapi pan a laihawm dal khat sia ama in Hathach pia hi. Mordecai in Esther tungah tua lai a piak natu, thupiang teng a son siat natu le kumpipa kungah Esther pai in ama mipuite atu hesuak a nget natu in vaitha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mordecai vaithak bangin Hathach in seam a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />tuaciang Esther in Mordecai tungah hi thu teng ama ma in puaksak kik hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Mihing khat pawpo, pa ahizong numei ahizong sapna nga ngawlin kumpipa taw kimu nuam in suum sungnung ah a tum le ama a thi kul hi. Tua in upadi hi a; kumpipa thudokte a kipan ngamsung mi theampo ii heak ahi hi. Hi upadi pial thei natu lampi khat bek om hi: kumpipa in mihing khat tungah a khamh ciangkhut a lapto le, tuasia ciang ama nuntakna kikhoaikhe hi. Keima zongh kumpipa ii hong sap ngawl zawk tha khat pha zo hi,” ci in sonsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Esther ii kam vaithak teng Mordecai in a nga ciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />ama in hi bangin a kidop natu thupuak hi: “Kumpi inn sungah na om hu in Jew dangte sangin ngammuang zaw tu in kingaisun heak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hi bang hun sungah thimthu in na om le, vantung pan Jew te atu huna hong pai in, Jew te kihun tu a, ahizong nangma na thi tu a, na pa ii bangkua mong tu hi. Ahitazong, akua in he tu ziam? — nangma kumpinu hong kisuasak zongh hi bang hun atu in a suak na hina meal kihe ngawl hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Esther in Mordecai tungah hi bang zo kik hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Pai in a, Susa khuapi sungah a om Jew mi theampo khawm in; antang in kei atu thu hong ngetsak tavun. Sun thum le zan thum sung an ahizong tui ahizong bangma ne heak vun. Ka khangmoi numeite le keima zongh tuabang ma in ka na vawt tu uh hi. Tua zawkciang, upadi bang ahibuatazong kumpipa kungah ka pai tu hi. Tuabang ka pai hu in ka thi a kul le zong a thi ka hi tu hi” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Mordecai in tua mun nusia in, Esther ii vawt tu a sawl theampo vawt hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A antan ni thum ni ciang Esther in a kumpinu puantual silh a, kumpi inn suum sungnung ah pai in, kumpi tokhum omna inndoi sang maingat in ding hi. Kumpipa sia a sungsang tokhum tungah to in kongbiang maingat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kumpipa in Esther kumpinu doipua sangah ding a mu ciang maipha pia in ama sangah a khamh ciangkhut laamto hi. Tuasia ciang Esther hong paito in, tua ciangkhut dawn len hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kumpipa in dongh a, “Esther kumpinu awng, bang ziam? Na dei sia hong son tan — ka ukna ngam a lang keak ahizong nga tu ni hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Esther in, “Kumpipa awng na lung a kim nale, noma atu in ka vawt anneakpoai ah ka leangna in nangma le Haman tu nitak hong haw le uhte uuk khi hi,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Esther ii leangna tu in kumpipa in Haman manlang tak a pai natu in samsak hi. Tuabangin kumpipa le Haman sia Esther ii anneakpoai ah pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sapittui a neak kawmin kumpipa in Esther tungah, “Na dei sia hong son ta'n, kong pia tu hi. Ka ngam phellang keak ahizong nong ngen le kong pia tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Esther in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Kumpipa awng, na dik a kong nget sia nong pia zo tu ahile, zing nitak ciangin noma kong ngintaakna anneakpoai dang khat ah nangma le Haman ka leangna tu in kong dei hi. Tua hun ciang ka dei sia kong son tu hi,” ci in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua anneakpoai pan Haman lungdam thinnuam in cia hi. Ahizong ama in kumpi inn kongbiang ah Mordecai mu a, ama mai a kaan ciang Mordecai in din ngawl, bangma zatakna lak ngawl ahikom Haman sia ama tungah thin uuk mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahizong ama in vei kenkon in a inn ah cia hi. Tuaciang a inn ah a lawmte sam a, a zi Zeresh zongh kihelsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama in a hauna teng, a tapa nei teng, kumpipa ii a za a laptona thu, le kumpi ulian dangte sangin a thupi zawkna thu teng amate tungah kisuangtaak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Haman in, “Hi teng bek hi ngawl lai hi. Esther kumpinu in kuama dang anvaak ngeingawl a, ahizong kumpipa le keima an hong vaak a, zing ciang zong hong sam kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahizong kumpi inn kongbiang ah a to Jew mi Mordecai ka mu lai teng hi thute theampo kei atu in khiakna nei ngawl hi,” ci lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ahiciang a zi le a lawmte theampo in, “Banghangin mihing a ki awklupsak natu in metre kul le nii a saang khuam khat vawt ngawl tu ni ziam? Zingsang ciang tuasia tungah Mordecai awklup natu in kumpipa tungah na ngen tu a, tua zawkciang lungdam takin an neakna poai ah na pai thei tu hi,” ci in ngaisutna pia uh hi. Haman in hi ngaisutna phasa ahikom a awklupsak natu in khuam phut hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua zan ma in kumpipa mu thei ngawl ahikom a kumpi ukna ngamsung thu tepteena zum laite lasakin ama tungah simsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua lai sungah kumpipa a kisuam nopna — a inndoite a cing cil kinget kumpi inn sung numei uk niite ahi Bigthana le Teresh in kumpipa a thalup nopna a phawk Mordecai ii pualaakna thu kihel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kumpipa in, “Hi thu hangin Mordecai tungah patoaina le tel piakna bangbang om kana ziam?” ci in dongh hi. A naseamte in, “Ama atu bangma kivawtsak ngawl hi,” ci in zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kumpipa in, “Kumpi inn sungah ka uliante akua om ziam?” ci in dongh hi. Tu in Haman sia zum suumsung hong tum zawk bek hi; ama in Mordecai awklup natu khuam taw kinging zo a, a awklupsak thei natu in kumpipa tungah a ngen tu hong pai zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ahiciang a naseamte in, “Hi lai ah Haman om a, nangma taw kimu tu in hong ngak hi,” ci in zo uh hi. Kumpipa in, “Sungtangsak vun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuabangin Haman tum a, kumpipa in ama tungah, “Ka patoai nop mama mi khat om hi. Tua pa atu bang vawt tu khi ziam?” ci hi. Haman in, “Tu in kumpipa in hi zata a, a patoai nop sia akua hi thei tu ziam? Keima hi nak vak ing!” ci in ngaisun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ahikom ama in kumpipa tungah, “Tua pa atu kumpi puan — nangma mama ii na silh puantual sia tuasia pa atu in lasak in. Kumpi kizepna teng na siphu tungah koisak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua zawkciang na kumpi ulian sung pan ulianbel khat in tua pa hi puantualte silhsak in a, siphu tungah tosakin khuapi khawlmun kaantan in paisak in. Amate a pai kawmin tua pa in: ‘Kumpipa in a patoai nop pa bangbangin tel pia ci sia, en vun!’ ci in taangko tahen” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuasia ciang kumpipa in Haman tungah, “Manlangin pai in a, kumpi puantual le ka siphu la in, tua patoai natu teng Jew mi Mordecai atu vawt ta'n. Tu a ngaisutna nong piak bangin ama tungah vawt siat in. Ama kumpi inn kongbiang ah a to na mu tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ahiciang Haman in puantualte le siphu la in, puantualte Mordecai in silhsak hi. Mordecai siphu tung to in khuapi khawlmun kaantan a, a paipui kawmin mipite tungah Haman in: “Kumpipa in a patoai nop pa bangbangin tel pia ci sia en vun!” ci in taangko hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Mordecai kumpi inn kongbiang ah heak kik a, Haman ahile maizumin a mai sealsa in inn ah manlang tak cia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama tungah thupiang teng a zi le a lawmte theampo tungah son siat hi. Tuasia ciang a zi le a lawm mipilte in, “Na vaang teng Mordecai tungah a theng tu hi zo hi. Ama Jew mi hi a, zo thei ngawl tu ni hi. Ama in nang hong zo nanak tu hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amate hi thu teng a son laitak Esther ii vawt anneakpoai ah Haman paipui tu in kumpi inn pan numei uk cil kingette manlang tak hong theng uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ahiciang Esther taw an nekhawm tu in kumpipa le Haman sia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />a nii veina pai uh hi. Sapittui a neak kawmin kumpipa in Esther thu dongh kik a, “Tu in Esther kumpinu awng, bang dei ni ziam? Hong son po ta'n, kong pia tu hi. Kumpi ukna ngam phellang keak ahizong hong pia tu khi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Esther kumpinu in, “Kumpipa na lung a kim a, kiniamkhiakna taw kong ngetna nong pia zo tu le, keima le ka mite hong nungtasak thei lete uuk khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka mite le keima, thalup tu in hong kizuak zo hi. Saltaang tu in hong kizuak hi zaw le, pau ngawlin ka om lel tu a, kong nawngkaisak buatu hi, ahizong kote hong kithatlum — hong kimon tu hi zo hi!” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Xerxes kumpipa in Esther kumpinu awng, “Tua bangte akua in vawt ngam tu ziam? Hisia pa koisungah om ziam?” ci in dongh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Esther in, “Kote ii ngal le kote hong vawtsia pa sia, hi mihing tatsia Haman hi!” ci in zo hi. Haman sia kumpipa le kumpinu maitang salh a lau citakin lau hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kumpipa a thinso sa in dingto a, inndoi sung pan pusuakin doi puasang kumpi huan sungah pai hi. Kumpipa in hi thu hangin daan a piak hunlam Haman in mu thei ahikom Esther kumpinu tungah a nuntak natu hesuak ngen nuam in nungsang ah taanglai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Haman in hesuak ngen tu in Esther tona ah a to suk bek laitakin huan sung pan kumpipa inndoi sungah hong sungtang kik hi. Hi bang a mu ciang kumpipa au in, “Hisia pa in ka kumpi inn sung hi lai, keima mai tatak ah kumpinu buanin khialpui nuam ziam?” ci hi. Kumpipa ii a kampau a man ma in numei uk cil kingette in Haman lutang puan khu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Harbonah a kici te sung pan khat in, “Kumpipa nangma nuntakna a hu Mordecai a awklupsak thei natu in, a khuam ngawngawn Haman in a inn ah phut zo hi, tuasia metre kul le nii saang hi,” ci hi. Kumpipa in, “Tuasia tungah Haman awklumsak tavun,” ci in thupia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuabangin Mordecai atu ama ii phusa khuam sia tungah Haman ki awklumsak hi. Tua zawkciang kumpipa thin uukna thai hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ni ma in Xerxes kumpipa in Esther kumpinu tungah Jew te ngalpa Haman neisa theampo pia hi. Esther in Mordecai taw mealheak khat a hina thu kumpipa tungah son a, tua hun a kipan Mordecai sia kumpipa omna ah kitumsak thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kumpipa in a min tupna a om a khutzungbu suutin, (Haman tung pan a laak kik sia ahi hi.) Mordecai pia hi. Esther in Haman neisa teng a keam tu in Mordecai koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Esther in kumpipa paupui kik a, a peang ah kisepsuk in kap hi. Ama in kumpipa tungah Agag suan Haman ii Jew te tungah thusia vawt in a thasawm nopna thu a tawlngaksak natu in ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kumpipa in a khamh ciangkhut Esther sangah laamto ahikom ama dingto in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Kumpipa awng, na lung a kim na le kei nong khualna in, hi thu maan tuak na sa le, nong hesuakna in Haman thupiak nate bangin a kisep suak ngawl natu — Agag suan Hammedatha tapa ii na kumpi ngamsung tengah Jew te theampo suksiat natu in tua thupiaknate khaktan natu thu thansakna hong suaksak ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka mite tungah hi tuasiatna tungin, ka mealheakte kithat le, bangbangin thuak zo thong tu khi ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Xerxes kumpipa in Esther kumpinu le Jew mi Mordecai tungah, “En vun, keima in Jew te a thasawm hu in Haman ka awklumsak zo a, a neisa teng Esther tungah ka pia zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahizong kumpipa min taw kumpi tazeik kituum in a suaksa thu thansakna sia kidawk kik thei ngawl tu hi. Ahizong Jew te tungah na dei bang po in lai at thei tu nu hi; tuaciang ka min taw lai at vun a, tua lai tungah kumpipa tazeik tuum thei tu nu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sivan tha, a tha thumna, ni 23 ni in hi thu piang hi. Mordecai in kumpipa ii thuzeakte samin India pan Ethiopia dong ngamke 127 teng ah Jew te, ngamukmangte, zum vaihawmte le uliante tungah a laithak tu teng khaw hi. Tua laithakte sia ngamke sim ah a zak kampau tek le a lai tek taw ki at a, Jew te tungah amate kam le a lai taw in ki at hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mordecai in tua laithakte Xerxes kumpipa min taw atsak a, ama in tua laite kumpi tazeik tuum hi. Tua laite kumpi siphu buk pan siphu tai ngaangte tung a tote in hawmsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua laithakte sungah kumpipa in khuapi theampo ah Jew te kipawl in amate le amate a kihuuk thei natu thu a omsakna thiang son hi. Ngamke khat pawpo ah ngam minam khat pawpo in ngalhiamte taw Jew pasalte, a patangte, a numeite a sim le Jew te in a simte do kik thei a; tuate khat zongh khoaikhe ngawlin thatlum thei tu a, a neisa teng laaksak thei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hi thutanna sia Persia ngamsung theampo ah Jew te a kithalup tu ni, tha sawm le tha niina, Adar tha ni sawm le ni thum ni pan kisimin, taangtunsak natu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hi thu sia upadi in kithangsak tu a, tua ni a thet ciang Jew te in a ngalte tungah phulam tu in a kingin khol thei natu in ngamke theampo ah mi theampo ii heak tu in kizasak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kumpipa thupiak bangin kumpi siphu tungto laitaite a manlang thei tawpin kipaisak hi. Tua thutanna sia Susa khuapi sung zongh ah kithangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mordecai sia vancii le a kaang ngelh kumpi puantual le a sa pha puanneal sandup te silh in, a etlawm mama khamh lukhu khu in kumpi inn pan pusuak hi. Tuasia ciang Susa khuapi lamdung teng ah patoaina aw te le lungdam in aunate hong nging hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jew te atu in thinnopna le suatakna, lungdamna le ngualzawna hong om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kumpipa ii thu thansakna lai a kisimna mun theampo, khuapi sim le ngamke sim ah Jew te in lungdam anneakpoai vawtin, lungdam poaikham ni nei kawkoai uh hi. A tatakin ci leang tu in midang tam mama in Jew te a kiitak hu in, Jew te suak uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Adar tha ni sawm le ni thum ni theng a, tua ni sia kumpi thu thansakna, a kisim tu ni, Jew te tung a ngalte ii ngalzo tu in a kilamet ni ahi hi. Ahizong Jew te in amate zo pumsai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kumpi ukna ngamsung khuapi sim, Jew te omna khawk teng ah Jew te a ngal vawt nuam khat pawpo a sim kik tu in amate sia a kipawl sa in om hi. Koima po ah a om mite in Jew te kiita in, khat zongh in langpan ngam ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A tatakin ci leang ngamke kumpi ulian theampo — ngamukmangte, zum vaihawmte le kumpi palaite — in Jew te panpui zaw uh hi, banghang ziam cile amate theampo in Mordecai kiita uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mordecai sia tu in kumpi inn sungah a vaang nei pa hi ci in, kumpi ukna ngam theampo ah a minthang a, tuaciang a vaangletna khang vaial hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ahikom Jew te in a ngalte tungah a uuk bang po in vawt thei uh hi. Amate in a ngalte namsau taw simin thatlum uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Susa khuapi sung mama ah Jew te in pasal 500 thatlum uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuate sungah Jew te ii a ngalpa, Hammedatha tapa Haman ii tapate sawm — Parshandatha, Dalphon, Aspatha, Poratha, Adalia, Aridatha, Parmashta, Arisai, Aridai le Vaizatha te kihel uh hi. Ahizong a neisa bangma kilaaksak ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ni ma in Susa khuapi sungah mihing a kithat za kumpipa tungah thu kizasak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaciang kumpipa in Esther kumpinu tungah, “Susa bebek ah Jew te in pasal za nga thatlum zo a, Haman tapate sawm kihel hi. Ngamke te sungah bang teng suaksak zo tu ziam! Tu in bang dei ni ziam? Na nga tu hi. Bang dang dei lai ni ziam hong son ta'n, na nga tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Esther in, “Kumpipa awng, na lung a kim le Jew te ii tu ni Susa ah a kingamtatsak thei bangma in zing ciangin ngamta kik tahen. Tuaciang Haman tapate sawm ii luanghawmte sia ngui awkna khuam tungah khaisak in,” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kumpipa in Esther kumpinu ci bangin sep tu thupia a, Susa khuapi sungah thangsak hi. Haman tapate sawm ii luanghawm sia ngual muna ah kikhai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Adar tha, ni sawm le ni li ni in Susa a om Jew te kikaikhawm kikin, khuapi sungah pasal 300 that thua uh hi. Ahizong a neisa bangma laaksak tuan ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ngamke tuatuam sungah a om Jew te zongh kipawl in amate le amate kihuu uh hi. Amate a ngaimaw, a ngalte75,000 a thalup na taw amate le amate kihuu uh hi. Ahizong a neisa bangma laaksak ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ni sia Adar tha, ni sawm le ni thum ni hi. A zing ciang, ni sawm le ni li ni sia, kithalupna om nawn ngawl a, lungnop anneakpoai vawt ni in zangh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahizong Susa a om Jew te in sawm le thum ni le sawm le li ni in a ngalte that a, tuaciang sawm le nga ni in tawlnga ahikom ni sawm le ni nga ni sia tawlngak ni suaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hi thu hangin khuanote sungah a teang Jew te in Adar tha, ni sawm le li ni sia lungdam tawlngak ni, anneakpoai vawt hun le khat le khat an letsong a kipiak hun in zangh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mordecai in hi thupiangte lai taw at in, Persia te ii kumpi ukna ngamsung theampo, a nai le a khuala a om Jew te tungah laithak kawkoai hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />kum simin Adar tha, sawm le li ni le sawm le nga nite sia tawlngak ni in a zak natu in son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua nite sia Jew te ii a ngalte a bosak ni hi a; tua tha sia heena le thinkiamna hun pan thinnopna le lungdamna hunin a kilaih tha ahi hi. Hi ni niite ngualnopna le anneakpoai in zangh tu a, khat le khat tung le a zawngte tungah an letsong kipiakna ni in a zak natu in amate kison hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuabangin Mordecai ii a zaaksak thute Jew te in zui in, tua poai sia kum simin a kivawt ngeina poai suak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Agag suan Jew mite ii a ngal pa — Hammedatha ii tapa Haman in Jew te mot natu a ni ciangtan tu in, (“purim” a kici) lai meetang lawnin khensat hi; Haman in Jew te mot siat tu ngeal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahizong kumpipa kungah Esther pai a, kumpipa in thupiakna lai suaksak in, Jew te thuak tu a ngealna sia Haman tungah tu kik zaw hi. Ama le a tapate sia ngui awkna khuam tungah ki awklumsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua hangin tawlngak nite sia Purim kici hi. Mordecai ii laithakna hang le amate tungah thupiang teng hangin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jew te in amate mama atu, a suan a paalte atu, Jew a suak thei tu khat pawpo atu in hi ni niite kum simin Mordecai thupiak bangin a hun maan in a kitan natu ngeina khat in vawt uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Jew te innkuan simin, khang khat zawk khang khat, ngamke le khuapi theampo ah hi Purim ni te phawk a, a tan tawntung tu in khensat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Abihail tanu, Esther kumpinu zongh in Mordecai taw laithak khat zongh at khawm a, Mordecai ii a at sa Purim thu teng nung pan ama thuneina bup omsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua Esther laithak sia Jew te theampo tungah thak a, Persia te ii kumpi ukna ngamsung ngamke 127 ah kihawm hi. Tuasia in Jew te ii kilem natu le ngammuan natu deisak a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />amate ii an tanna le khuangai hunte atu in ngeina a neisa bangin, Purim poai nite sia amate le a suan a paalte in a hun maan in a tan natu lamlak hi. Hi thu sia Mordecai le Esther kumpinu ii a piakkhop thupiakna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Purim poai taw kisai zui tu ngeinate a kipsak Esther ii thupiakna sia laizial khat sungah ki at hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Xerxes kumpipa in a ukna ngamsung tuipi hui ngamkhente ah a teangte le a ngamsung sangah a teang mite sia zawthawk thu taw sawlin na seamsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama ii a thupi mama le a lamdang mama a nasepnate theampo le Mordecai sia dinmun saang ah a za a khattona thu teng, Persia le Media kumpite ii zum thu tepteena sungah kikhum siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jew mi Mordecai sia Xerxes kumpipa mama ii a dom kik ulianbel ahi hi. Ama sia Jew a mipuite in zakta a, diksa mama uh hi. Ama in a mipuite phat natu le a suan a paalte theampo ii ngammuan natu in naseam hi.
  </para>
</usx>
